## 1. UI/UX Experience Audit
### Strengths
*   **Visual Design:** The site uses a trustworthy manufacturing of teal/green and dark grey. The aesthetic is clean, modern, and uncluttered.
*   **Animations:** Micro-interactions (scroll animations, button hovers) are smooth and enhance the premium feel of the platform.
*   **Navigation:** Intuitive top-level navigation (`How It Works`, `Blog`, `About`, `FAQ`) makes information easy to find.
*   **Responsiveness:** The layout adapts fluidly to different screen sizes.

### Critical Issues
*   **Branding Inconsistency:** On the sign-up page (`app.careerlead.ai/signup`), the introductory text refers to the platform as **"CareerCompass AI"**. This is a major trust signal failure; users may think they are on the wrong site.
*   **Missing Visual Assets:** The browser console reports multiple `404 Not Found` errors for basic assets like `favicon.ico`, `icon-32.png`, and `icon-192.png`. This results in broken icons in browser tabs and home screen shortcuts.
*   **Form UX:** Input fields on the signup page are missing `autocomplete` attributes, forcing users to manually type information browsers could otherwise auto-fill.

## 2. Technical Deep Dive (New)
### Mobile & Performance
*   **Mobile Optimisation:** Excellent. Tested on 375x667 viewport. No horizontal scrolling or layout shifts. Touch targets (buttons, links) are well-sized and accessible.
*   **Menu:** The mobile hamburger menu functions smoothly, offering a clean, full-screen navigation experience.

### Accessibility (A11y)
*   **Compliance:** Good.
    *   **Alt Text:** Primary images (Logo, Dashboard previews) have descriptive `alt` tags.
    *   **Contrast:** Primary buttons (Teal/White) have a ~4.5:1 contrast ratio, meeting WCAG AA standards.

### SEO & Social Validity
*   **Social Sharing:** Fully optimized.
    *   **Open Graph:** `og:image`, `og:title`, and `og:description` are correctly set. Sharing the link on WhatsApp or Twitter will generate a professional preview card.
    *   **Meta Description:** Present and keyword-rich, targeting "career guidance" and "Africa".

### Legal & Compliance (Gap Identified)
*   **Cookie Consent:** **MISSING.** No cookie banner appears on load.
    *   **Risk:** This may violate GDPR and emerging African data protection laws if user data is tracked.
*   **Policy Links:** Privacy Policy and Terms of Service links in the footer are present and functional.

## 3. Content & Market Fit
*   **Clear Value Proposition:** "Navigate Your Career Path with AI-Powered Guidance" is a strong, clear headline.
*   **Regional Focus:** The content is excellently tailored for the **African market** (Ghana, Nigeria, Kenya). High-value blog posts like *"Software Developer Salaries Across Africa 2025"* and *"CV Writing Guide for Ghana & Nigeria"* show deep understanding of the target audience.
*   **Tone:** Professional, empowering, and forward-looking.

## 3. Technical & Vulnerability Check
### Security Observations
*   **Authentication:** Uses standard **Google OAuth**, which is secure and convenient.
*   **Robots & Sitemap:**
    *   `robots.txt` is correctly configured to allow marketing pages indexation while disallowing application routes (`/dashboard`, `/profile`, etc.).
    *   `sitemap.xml` is well-structured and up-to-date with priority tags.
*   **HTTPS:** Fully enforced.

### Technical Bugs
*   **Session Management Error:** A `400 Bad Request` error was observed in the console related to a **Supabase token refresh**.
    *   **Impact:** This suggests that user sessions might not persist correctly, potentially forcing users to log in repeatedly or causing "unauthorized" errors during use.
*   **Console Noise:** The high volume of 404s for assets clutters the logs and degrades perceived quality.

## Recommendations
### Immediate Fixes (High Priority)
- [ ] **Fix Branding:** Update the text on `app.careerlead.ai/signup` to say "CareerLead AI" instead of "CareerCompass AI".
- [ ] **Fix Token Refresh:** Investigate the Supabase client configuration to resolve the `400` token refresh error. This is critical for user retention.
- [ ] **Restore Assets:** Upload the missing `favicon.ico` and accessible icon files to the server root or public assets folder.
- [ ] **Add Cookie Banner:** Implement a simple cookie consent banner to ensure legal compliance.

### Polish & Optimization (Medium Priority)
- [ ] **Form Attributes:** Add `autocomplete` attributes (e.g., `autocomplete="email"`, `autocomplete="new-password"`) to sign-up forms.
- [ ] **SEO Tuning:** Ensure the inconsistent branding doesn't appear in meta descriptions or title tags.
